      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sales Tax (Amendment) Bill 2019"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 101 the following section: “Service of summons 101a. (1) Every summons issued by a court against any person in connection with any civil or criminal proceedings under this Act may be served on the person named therein— (a) by delivering the summons to the person or any adult member of his family or any of his servants residing with him at his usual or last-known place of residence; (b) by leaving the summons at his usual or last-known place of residence or business in an envelope addressed to the person; (c) by sending the summons by registered post addressed to the person at his usual or last-known place of residence or business; or (d) where the person is a company, a limited liability partnership, a firm, a society, an association or other body of persons— (i) by delivering the summons to the secretary or other like officer of the company, limited liability partnership, firm, society, association or other body of persons at its registered office or principal place of business; or (ii) by sending the summons by registered post addressed to the company, limited liability partnership, firm, society, association or other body of persons at its registered office or principal place of business. (2) Any summons sent by registered post to any person in accordance with subsection (1) or by delivering the summons to the person or to any adult member of his family or any of his servant residing with him shall be deemed to be duly served on the person. (3) When a summons issued by a court is served, an affidavit of the service purporting to be made before an officer duly authorized to administer an oath shall be admissible in evidence.”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Sales Tax (Amendment) Act 2019."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette. Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_2__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Sales Tax Act 2018 [Act 806], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in section 2—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of “designated areas”, by substituting for the words “and Tioman” the words “, Tioman and Pangkor”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of “special areas”, by substituting for the words “and the Joint Development Area” the words “the Joint Development Area, and a petroleum supply base licensed under section 77b of the Customs Act 1967”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “taxable person” the following definition: ‘ “Pangkor” means the Pangkor Island, Mentagor Island, Giam Island, Simpan Island, Tukun Terindak Island, Pelanduk Island, Anak Pelanduk Island, Landak Island, Batu Orang Tua and Batu Jambal;’. Amendment of section 3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/5/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for paragraph 3(1)(b) the following paragraph: “(b) in relation to petroleum, the process of refining that includes the separation, conversion, purification and blending of refinery streams or petrochemical streams.”. Amendment of section 9"
      }
    },
